<title>JAPAN: NOK Corp rises to new 1997 high.</title>
<headline>NOK Corp rises to new 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NOK Corp shares rose to a new calnedar 1997 high in Friday morning trade, ahead of the firm's group earnings announcement later in the day, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0113 GMT, the leading oilseal maker's shares added 12 yen to reach 840. Earlier, it briefly touched 845 yen.</p>
